(countries, would it not be a great mistake to conclude, that the) Tj T*
(quantity of corn awarded to the labourer, would in each country be in) Tj T*
(proportion to the facility of production?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If the shoes and clothing of the labourer, could, by improvements in) Tj T*
(machinery, be produced by one fourth of the labour now necessary to) Tj T*
(their production, they would probably fall 75 per cent.; but so far is) Tj T*
