(of its riches would increase. It would become rich by parsimony; by) Tj T*
(diminishing its expenditure on objects of luxury and enjoyment; and) Tj T*
(employing those savings in reproduction.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In the second case, there will not necessarily be either any diminished) Tj T*
